# Deliberate findings are exempted in .gitleaks.toml by value, not listed here
# by fingerprint.
#
# Fingerprints identify a finding by commit, path, rule and line. Three of those
# four change for reasons that have nothing to do with whether the string is a
# secret: editing the file above it, or rewriting history. Both happened here,
# and each time the exemption silently stopped applying and the scan failed on a
# credential that had not changed at all.
#
# Allowlisting a whole file would hide the next real finding in it. Allowlisting
# the exact value does not.
